        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Together with our Essential Materials businesses, we have developed our roads offering to provide customers with quality, flexibility, speed, expertise and convenience through our deep market knowledge and highly capable team of professionals.",
        "start_character": 4508,
        "end_character": 4751
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We offer these products directly for sale and integrate them into our downstream products and services.",
        "start_character": 21558,
        "end_character": 21661
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With a particular focus on below-ground construction, we are a leading provider of multi-material products that renew and protect the critical infrastructure that enhances the daily lives of millions of people.",
        "start_character": 5193,
        "end_character": 5403
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "With our capabilities in manufacturing, installation, maintenance and circularity, we deliver a range of innovative products and services for our customers to better connect our communities, from major public highway infrastructure projects to residential roads, airports and parking lots.",
        "start_character": 4028,
        "end_character": 4317
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Working closely with our Essential Materials and Roads businesses, we provide materials, products and engineering services to enable the transition to a more durable built environment.",
        "start_character": 5008,
        "end_character": 5192
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "From time to time, we are required by law and/or contractual obligations to investigate and remediate releases of hazardous substances at our manufacturing sites and at sites where hazardous substances from our operations may have been disposed of.",
        "start_character": 22883,
        "end_character": 23131
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We are also required to obtain permits and adhere to applicable restrictions, often including establishing appropriate environmental management systems, to minimize the risk that necessary permits are revoked, modified or not renewed.",
        "start_character": 22370,
        "end_character": 22604
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to adapt engagement strategies, ways of working, and leadership development approaches based on employee feedback.",
        "start_character": 35179,
        "end_character": 35305
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We continue to roll out our Frontline Leadership Program, which provides leadership development training for frontline supervisors across CRH, advancing the skills of our employees across a range of programs such as management, inclusive leadership, and safety.",
        "start_character": 36319,
        "end_character": 36580
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We have a network of experts across our businesses collaborating in the research and development of innovative solutions.",
        "start_character": 17113,
        "end_character": 17234
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We invest in talent development throughout our businesses, empowering our employees across all levels of education and employment to grow their careers through personal and professional development opportunities to ensure we have a pipeline of talent in place for the next generation of leaders at CRH.",
        "start_character": 36016,
        "end_character": 36318
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001628280-26-009043",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001628280-26-009043-87f56e0348da3ab1",
        "accession_number": "0001628280-26-009043",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-18",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We operate both unionized and non-unionized workplaces.",
